\label{prop:periodic}
For every $p\in(0,1)$, there is an open $1$-periodic set $H\subseteq\R$
with $\rho(H)\le6p$ such that

whole.text:
\begin{equation*}
 \text{for every }x\in\R\text{ and }t\in[1,2],
 \quad x+tq^n\in H\text{ for some integer }n\ge1.
\end{equation*}

